WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.007 --> 00:00:18.809
Benjamin Bunny sat by the road.

2
00:00:18.810 --> 00:00:22.344
Clop, clop! Clop, clop!

3
00:00:22.345 --> 00:00:26.345
A horse walked along the road.

4
00:00:26.346 --> 00:00:34.963
The horse was pulling a wagon.

5
00:00:34.964 --> 00:00:40.982
"It's the farmer and his wife," thought Benjamin.

6
00:00:40.983 --> 00:00:44.076
"They are going to town."

7
00:00:44.077 --> 00:00:46.695
Benjamin smiled.

8
00:00:46.696 --> 00:00:54.984
"I'll find my cousin Peter!"

9
00:00:54.985 --> 00:01:02.152
Benjamin ran to Peter's tree.

10
00:01:02.153 --> 00:01:06.213
He peeked inside.

11
00:01:06.214 --> 00:01:09.545
Mrs. Rabbit was knitting.

12
00:01:09.546 --> 00:01:15.477
"I don't want to see her," thought Benjamin.

13
00:01:15.478 --> 00:01:21.897
He saw Flopsy, Mopsy, and Cotton-tail.

14
00:01:21.898 --> 00:01:28.400
"Where's Peter?" thought Benjamin.

15
00:01:28.401 --> 00:01:36.504
He went to the other side of the tree.

16
00:01:36.505 --> 00:01:42.451
He crawled down a hole.

17
00:01:42.452 --> 00:01:45.344
And there was Peter.

18
00:01:45.345 --> 00:01:49.417
He was wearing a red handkerchief.

19
00:01:49.418 --> 00:01:53.106
He looked sad.

20
00:01:53.107 --> 00:01:56.806
"Peter!" said Benjamin.

21
00:01:56.807 --> 00:02:00.629
"What happened to you?

22
00:02:00.630 --> 00:02:03.764
Where are your clothes?"

23
00:02:03.765 --> 00:02:08.724
Peter sniffed.

24
00:02:08.725 --> 00:02:12.567
"I lost them in the farmer's garden.

25
00:02:12.568 --> 00:02:15.575
I went there yesterday.

26
00:02:15.576 --> 00:02:22.522
The farmer chased me."

27
00:02:22.523 --> 00:02:26.935
"I have good news," said Benjamin.

28
00:02:26.936 --> 00:02:30.396
"The farmer and his wife went to town.

29
00:02:30.397 --> 00:02:36.200
We can look for your clothes!"
